---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/redaction-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/redaction-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="What the redaction step let through"
  caption="Counted on the saved packets, before the fix and after it. 505 scores still rest on reads of the before packets until the re-run."
>
  Paired bars showing the share of packets given to the scoring model that still contained identifying text. A piece of the applicant's own name: 35 percent before the fix, 6 percent after. A City, ST line: 69 percent before, 0 percent after.
</Chart>
